@adminUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8900

### Check that the proxy is running, how many routes it holds and why one failed
GET {{adminUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Read the current route table
GET {{adminUrl}}/routes
Accept: application/json

### Replace the whole route table
POST {{adminUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "develop.example.com": "example.com",
  "test.example.com": "example.com:8443"
}

### Remove every route
POST {{adminUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Rejected: the body must be a JSON object of host/target pairs
POST {{adminUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

["develop.example.com"]

### Rejected: a target must be a string
POST {{adminUrl}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "develop.example.com": 8443
}

### Rejected: unknown path
GET {{adminUrl}}/unknown
Accept: application/json

### Rejected: unsupported method
DELETE {{adminUrl}}/routes
Accept: application/json

### Preflight request the extension sends before a route update
OPTIONS {{adminUrl}}/routes
Origin: chrome-extension://abcdefghijklmnopabcdefghijklmnop
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type
